  "summary": "A 26-year-old Rhinebeck, NY man was arrested and charged with felony criminal mischief and arson after allegedly setting a Flock ALPR camera on fire, sparking a brush fire. The incident followed the Dutchess County Sheriff and DA's recent withdrawal of support for Flock technology amid community concerns.",
